<title>USA: FastComm acquires data communications co.</title>
<headline>FastComm acquires data communications co.</headline>
<dateline>STERLING, Va. 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>FastComm Communications Corp said Wednesday it has acquired  Comstat Datacom Corp, a privately held manufacturer of data communications products, for an undisclosed amount of stock.</p>
<p>The transaction was effective January 31. Comstat is to be operated as a subsidiary of FastComm. Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>FastComm designs, manufactures and sells access products for public and private digital networks.</p>
